# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# LeaseKo Monorepo — Root Environment Variables
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# This root file is an ORIENTATION DOCUMENT for new developers.
# There are NO required variables at the monorepo root level.
#
# Each app manages its own environment file:
#
#   apps/api/.env.example   ← Backend (NestJS) — copy to apps/api/.env
#   apps/web/.env.example   ← Frontend (Next.js) — copy to apps/web/.env.local
#
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Quick Start (minimum values for local development)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
#   cp apps/api/.env.example  apps/api/.env
#   cp apps/web/.env.example  apps/web/.env.local
#
#   apps/api/.env (required):
#     DATABASE_URL=postgresql://postgres:postgres@localhost:5432/leaseKo
#     REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379
#     FRONTEND_URL=http://localhost:3000
#
#   apps/web/.env.local (required):
#     NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:3001
#
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Future Workspace-Level Variables (Turborepo Remote Cache)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Uncomment when enabling Turborepo Remote Cache (CI/CD):
#
# TURBO_TOKEN=
# TURBO_TEAM=
